version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-29

license: MIT

repository-code: https://github.com/kusuma86/multi-uav-decision-reliability

abstract: >-
  This repository provides simulation code and generated
  data supporting a study of decision reliability in
  multi-UAV task allocation under imperfect capability
  estimation. It includes factorial policy experiments,
  decision-level reliability analysis, matched
  perfect-information comparisons, and resource-constrained
  simulations with battery and spatial travel costs.
  All experimental data are synthetically generated.

keywords:
  - multi-UAV task allocation
  - decision reliability
  - capability estimation uncertainty
  - uncertainty-aware allocation
  - factorial ablation
  - resource-constrained simulation
  - perfect-information comparison
  - reproducibility
